Composition Fixed Color Fill =
SWITCH (
    MAX ( 'MappedParameterTwo'[Category2] ),
    "EngagementCodeList", "#4555D6",
    "AlphaCode", "#8C97E8",
    "CustodianDisplayName", "#2D3B68",
    "EFileName", "#6B7CFF",
    "#4555D6"
)
// Bind to the ColorOverrideFill field in Deneb. Gives each distinct
// column that MappedParameterTwo can resolve to its own pinned color,
// drawn from the design system's level fill palette.
//
// This assigns one color per COLUMN NAME (whichever candidate the
// field parameter is sliced to), not per distinct value within that
// column. For per-value colors (e.g. a unique color per
// EngagementCodeList value), you need a rank-based measure -- see
// HANDOFF.md's open item on O(N^2) RANKX performance at high
// cardinality.
//
// Uses MAX, not SELECTEDVALUE -- MappedParameterTwo's columns are
// linked into a composite key ("Group By Columns"), and
// SELECTEDVALUE throws "part of composite key" (same confirmed
// finding as MappedParameter). See waffle/categoryfixedcolor.dax
// for the original pattern.
